  "title": "IPv4: Handle empty data packets",
  "description": "1. Allow IPv4 packets with no data (header length * 4 = total length) to still be passed through fragmentation.\n2. Create an expert item (ip.zero_data_length) for easy filtering on flagging such packets.\n\nFixes #21258\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
